   $q$Which words best fill the blank at the start of sentence 4?$q$, $q$[{"text":"On the other hand, it is surprising that","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contrast"},{"text":"As a result of the stars and colors,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"To conclude, it is very clear that","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"premature-conclusion"},{"text":"This low price is important because","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$This low price is important because$q$, $q$Sentence 4 explains why the low cost in sentence 3 matters, so "This low price is important because" links the two ideas. Children growing has nothing to do with stars and colors, so that choice creates a false cause.$q$, 'draft', 'db32e9c7-e803-5ade-877f-b477ea42993f')
